# Keep the release tarball (git archive) to what an end user actually needs to
# run a build. Everything listed here is repo infrastructure or scratch space.
#
# docs/ and plans/ are gitignored, so they are never in the archive anyway -
# they are listed defensively in case a note ever gets committed by accident.
# .idea/ is likewise gitignored.
#
# Nothing the build needs may appear below: build-ffmpeg, src/, web-install*.sh,
# the Dockerfiles, LICENSE and README.md all have to stay in the tarball.
.github/        export-ignore
.idea/          export-ignore
docs/           export-ignore
plans/          export-ignore
